            content: `<div class="bg-purple-50 rounded-3xl p-6 border-2 border-purple-100 shadow-sm"><h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-purple-700 mb-6 text-center">🖼️ Mengenal Antarmuka Scratch Jr!</h3><div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-md border-b-4 border-purple-200 mb-6"><h4 class="text-sm font-black text-purple-800 uppercase mb-3">📖 Bagian-bagian Scratch Jr</h4><p class="text-sm text-purple-900 leading-relaxed">Scratch Jr punya beberapa bagian penting yang harus kita kenal agar bisa membuat program dengan lancar!</p></div><div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-md border-b-4 border-purple-200 mb-6"><h4 class="text-sm font-black text-purple-800 uppercase mb-3">🗺️ Peta Antarmuka</h4><div class="space-y-2"><div class="bg-purple-100 p-3 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-2xl">🎭</span><div class="text-left"><p class="text-xs font-black text-purple-800">Panggung (Stage)</p><p class="text-[10px] text-purple-600">Tempat sprite tampil dan bergerak</p></div></div><div class="bg-purple-100 p-3 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-2xl">🧩</span><div class="text-left"><p class="text-xs font-black text-purple-800">Palet Blok</p><p class="text-[10px] text-purple-600">Koleksi blok yang bisa diseret ke area skrip</p></div></div><div class="bg-purple-100 p-3 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-2xl">📜</span><div class="text-left"><p class="text-xs font-black text-purple-800">Area Skrip</p><p class="text-[10px] text-purple-600">Tempat menyusun blok menjadi program</p></div></div><div class="bg-purple-100 p-3 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-2xl">🟩</span><div class="text-left"><p class="text-xs font-black text-purple-800">Bendera Hijau</p><p class="text-[10px] text-purple-600">Tombol untuk memulai menjalankan program</p></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-purple-100 p-4 rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-200"><p class="text-sm font-bold text-purple-800">💡 <strong>Tips:</strong> Klik bendera hijau 🟩 untuk memulai! Klik tombol merah 🛑 untuk menghentikan program. 🎮</p></div></div>`,
